WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.050 --> 00:00:02.109
PAUL RUDD
And for the rest of you kids out there,

00:00:02.159 --> 00:00:03.417
a word of advice...

00:00:04.628 --> 00:00:09.076
Oh, hello.
Didn't see you there.

00:00:09.127 --> 00:00:13.920
Hi. I'm Paul Rudd. You might
know me as Scott Lang a.k.a. Ant-Man.

00:00:13.970 --> 00:00:18.833
Now, Scott is many things.
Former convict, a dad, an Avenger...

00:00:19.415 --> 00:00:21.708
But he's also a best-selling author.

00:00:23.010 --> 00:00:29.667
And now you can purchase my... "his" very
real book: Look Out for the Little Guy!

00:00:30.224 --> 00:00:34.912
That's right. This once movie prop is now
an actual real-life book you can purchase

00:00:34.962 --> 00:00:37.467
wherever books are sold.
How's that for meta?

00:00:37.859 --> 00:00:42.375
In this new book I'm almost certain was
not written by me, we pull back the

00:00:42.425 --> 00:00:47.667
curtain and uncover the man behind
Ant-Man, Scott Lang. Who is he?

00:00:48.264 --> 00:00:51.569
What's he like?
Why does he look so much like me?

00:00:51.620 --> 00:00:55.958
It's a tale as old as time that's
so good it practically reads itself.

00:00:56.009 --> 00:00:58.775
A publication similar to but
not the New York Times calls it...

00:01:02.464 --> 00:01:05.845
So, if you're like me and you've only ever
read the back covers of books to

00:01:05.895 --> 00:01:10.021
say you've read them, do
yourself a favor and pick up a copy of

00:01:10.071 --> 00:01:12.723
Look Out for the Little Guy!
It'll change your life.

00:01:15.557 --> 00:01:18.208
Can I say that? No?

00:01:19.942 --> 00:01:21.676
It might change your life.

